{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.dvd_mod_sub\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">dvd_mod_sub</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">↑<span class=\"fn\">F</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Dvd.dvd\">∣</a> <span class=\"fn\">↑(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">↑<span class=\"fn\">x</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.dvd_mod_sub","kind":"theorem","line":66,"name":"MPN.dvd_mod_sub","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/NatMod.lean#L66-L67"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.mod_eq_iff_dvd\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">mod_eq_iff_dvd</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b </span><span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Iff\">↔</a> <span class=\"fn\">↑<span class=\"fn\">F</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Dvd.dvd\">∣</a> <span class=\"fn\">↑<span class=\"fn\">a</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">↑<span class=\"fn\">b</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A congruence of natural numbers is a divisibility of their difference in `Int`.","docLink":"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.mod_eq_iff_dvd","kind":"theorem","line":61,"name":"MPN.mod_eq_iff_dvd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/NatMod.lean#L61-L64"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.mod_cancel_add\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">mod_cancel_add</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b </span><span class=\"fn\">c </span><span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hF</span> : <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : (<span class=\"fn\">a</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> (<span class=\"fn\">b</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Adding the same number to both sides of a congruence modulo `F > 0` can be undone.","docLink":"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.mod_cancel_add","kind":"theorem","line":50,"name":"MPN.mod_cancel_add","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/NatMod.lean#L50-L59"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.sq_of_neg_one\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">sq_of_neg_one</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hy</span> : (<span class=\"fn\">y</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The square of `-1` is `1`, modulo `F`.","docLink":"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.sq_of_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":41,"name":"MPN.sq_of_neg_one","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/NatMod.lean#L41-L48"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.pow_odd_mod\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">pow_odd_mod</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">F </span><span class=\"fn\">u</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hy</span> : (<span class=\"fn\">y</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hu</span> : <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\">(<span class=\"fn\">y</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`-1` to an odd power is `-1`, modulo `F`.","docLink":"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.pow_odd_mod","kind":"theorem","line":35,"name":"MPN.pow_odd_mod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/NatMod.lean#L35-L39"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.dvd_pow_odd_add_one\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">dvd_pow_odd_add_one</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">u</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hu</span> : <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Dvd.dvd\">∣</a> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`y + 1` divides `yᵘ + 1` for an odd `u`.","docLink":"./MPN/NatMod.html#MPN.dvd_pow_odd_add_one","kind":"theorem","line":17,"name":"MPN.dvd_pow_odd_add_one","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/NatMod.lean#L17-L33"}}],"imports":["Init"],"instances":[],"name":"MPN.NatMod"}